# Kipuka EST — Server-Side Key Generation (RFC 7030 §4.4)
Output docs/gifs/07-est-serverkeygen.mp4
Set FontSize 16
Set Width 1200
Set Height 700
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set Padding 20
Set TypingSpeed 30ms
Set Shell "bash"

Type "# EST Server-Side Key Gen — kipuka-rsa.cert-lab.local (RFC 7030 §4.4)"
Enter
Sleep 1s
Type "./lab est-serverkeygen -d sskg-sensor.cert-lab.local -p rsa"
Enter
Sleep 8s
